Dialogue: 10,0:01:07.01,0:01:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Então foi assim que ele se\Ntornou um espírito heroico.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:12.76,0:01:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Que idiota.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:46.44,0:02:48.69,Default,,0,750,0,,Perdão?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:48.69,0:02:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hein? Só até as 7h30.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:51.36,0:02:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Mais do que isso e me atraso para o colégio.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.03,0:02:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,só me resta fazer somente\No que eu achar correto.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.79,0:03:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu me referia à Guerra do Santo Graal.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.87,0:03:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,mas não cederei a certas coisas.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:03.71,0:03:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vou comprometer nada nem ninguém!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.76,0:03:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,O que poderia eu dizer?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.89,0:03:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Reconheço que ele não é de muita utilidade numa luta,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.39,0:03:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,mas não tenho do que reclamar dele como aliado.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:19.47,0:03:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Digo...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.39,0:03:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Tenho a certeza de que o Emiya-kun nunca me trairia, aconteça o que acontecer.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.52,0:03:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouça.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.57,0:03:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Aquele garoto não foi feito para vencer.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.61,0:03:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Se você precisa se aliar a alguém, até mesmo a Caster seria melhor.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.16,0:03:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Não diga absurdos, Archer.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.16,0:03:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Está me dizendo para ficar do mesmo lado que aquele monstro?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.50,0:03:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim, ela é um monstro, mas age como uma verdadeira maga.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.59,0:03:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso mesmo.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.97,0:03:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Gostei delas. E daí?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:59.51,0:04:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Estes são os tópicos dos anúncios.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.60,0:04:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Creio que seja desnecessário acrescentar,\Nmas não se esqueça de trancar as portas.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.98,0:04:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Com certeza, nem era preciso dizer.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.94,0:04:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Com certeza, nem era preciso dizer.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.07,0:04:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hein, Issei.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.82,0:04:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,O que foi, Emiya?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.41,0:04:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Uma coisa vem me intrigando.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.75,0:04:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Você e o Prof. Kuzuki são próximos?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.46,0:04:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós, realmente, nos damos bem.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.76,0:04:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Afinal de contas, ele é\Ncomo um irmão para mim.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.47,0:04:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Como um irmão?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.51,0:04:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Souichirou— digo,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.18,0:04:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,É um sujeito quieto, mas também\Num homem franco e consciente.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.31,0:04:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,É um sujeito quieto, mas também\Num homem franco e consciente.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.03,0:04:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,É evidente que o considero um irmão.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.34,0:05:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,poderia me dizer se alguma\Ncoisa aconteceu no templo?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.88,0:05:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Não tenho nada a dizer para quem\Nescuta a conversa dos outros!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.84,0:05:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,O que é que vocês têm
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.31,0:05:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,para ficarem assim?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.89,0:05:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Uma coisa meio que aconteceu.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.65,0:05:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele vai se casar em breve.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.78,0:05:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Há duas semanas, ele apareceu com\Numa mulher que diz ser sua noiva.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.15,0:05:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Fiquei feliz por eles, embora tenha\Nme parecido um tanto estranho.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.12,0:05:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,De momento, eles vivem juntos em\Numa morada separada do resto.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.67,0:05:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,De momento, eles vivem juntos em\Numa morada separada do resto.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.08,0:05:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been curious about this for a while.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.88,0:05:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Depois do que aconteceu com o Issei,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.80,0:05:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,acho loucura suspeitar de alguém\Nsó por morar no templo Ryuudou.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.55,0:06:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,acho loucura suspeitar de alguém\Nsó por morar no templo Ryuudou.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.68,0:06:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Por quê? O Mestre tem que ser\Num sujeito sombrio como ele.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.85,0:06:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A tal noiva é a Feiticeira.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.35,0:06:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Atacamos de noite!\NMelhor ir se preparando.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.52,0:06:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Atacamos de noite!\NMelhor ir se preparando.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.98,0:06:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Não dá para saber se ele\Nvirá à escola amanhã.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.82,0:06:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Para vermos se ele é o Mestre, vamos\Ntestá-lo enquanto vai para casa.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.04,0:06:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Testá-lo como?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:28.16,0:06:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Vou acertar um disparo Gandr nele.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.34,0:06:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Se ele for uma pessoa normal, vai acabar\Nnuma cama resfriado por uns dias.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.05,0:06:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso também seria um problema.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.63,0:06:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso também seria um problema.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.01,0:06:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Se, por ventura, ele for um Mestre,\Nvamos ter uma briga no ato.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.13,0:06:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Aí não vai ter espaço para diálogo.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:44.60,0:06:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Assim não seria melhor para nós?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.35,0:06:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,É que você vai estar em perigo.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:50.39,0:06:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,É que você vai estar em perigo.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.27,0:06:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, não estou nem aí.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.78,0:07:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Já que é assim, vou sozinha.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:00.82,0:07:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Está bem. Vou com você.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.82,0:07:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Então vão atacar o Mestre\Nda Feiticeira agora à noite?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.91,0:07:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos. Ainda não se sabe\Nbem se ele é o Mestre,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.63,0:07:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,mas, nesta altura, temos\Nque ver para crer.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.30,0:07:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Posso ver a sua relutância,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:23.93,0:07:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We've found him.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.72,0:07:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,After what happened with Issei,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.60,0:07:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's crazy to suspect someone \Njust because they live at Ryuudou Temple.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.98,0:07:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Pudera eu fazer como ele.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.02,0:07:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Pudera eu fazer como ele.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.27,0:07:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That "fiancée" of his is Caster.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.82,0:07:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Fiquei besta agora?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.32,0:07:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Fiquei besta agora?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.11,0:07:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Fiquei besta agora?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.74,0:07:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.12,0:07:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.32,0:07:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.78,0:07:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no guarantee that Kuzuki-sensei will come to school tomorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.75,0:07:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll test him on his way home to see if he's a Master.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.79,0:07:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Test him? How?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:59.63,0:08:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hit him with a light Gandr shot.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:02.01,0:08:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if Kuzuki-sensei's a normal person, \Nhe'll only end up bedridden for a few days.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.85,0:08:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Quando liguei para a Fuji, digo,\Npara a Prof. Fujimura, há pouco,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.85,0:08:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Quando liguei para a Fuji, digo,\Npara a Prof. Fujimura, há pouco,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.52,0:08:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,ela disse que o Prof. Kuzuki\Nainda estava na escola.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.77,0:08:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ou seja, ele não mudou\Nem nada a rotina de sempre.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.27,0:08:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Assim, a qualquer instante,\Nele deve sair da escola.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.07,0:08:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Assim, a qualquer instante,\Nele deve sair da escola.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.49,0:08:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Rin, por que o Arqueiro não veio?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.70,0:08:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mandei ficar em casa.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.91,0:08:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Não quero que ele fique\Nperto da Feiticeira.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.54,0:08:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Como assim?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.46,0:08:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos nos apressar.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.80,0:08:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Esta é a única estrada que\Nleva ao templo Ryuudou,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.59,0:08:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,então ele tem de passar por aqui.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.09,0:08:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,então ele tem de passar por aqui.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.51,0:08:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Armamos a nossa emboscada aqui.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.10,0:08:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Lugar perfeito, não acham?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.82,0:09:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Que tal?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.33,0:09:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Parece que chegou.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.65,0:09:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Espera!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.53,0:09:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Espera!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.07,0:09:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Pensei ter avisado, Souichirou.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.53,0:09:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Uma vez começada a guerra, seria\Npreciso ficar no templo Ryuudou.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.91,0:09:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Já não importa.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.67,0:10:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Capturamos a nossa presa.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.08,0:10:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Capturamos a nossa presa.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.30,0:10:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.51,0:10:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.81,0:10:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos, sai daí, mago tolo.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.56,0:10:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos, sai daí, mago tolo.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.06,0:10:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Tens três segundos.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.27,0:10:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Passados eles, responderei adequadamente.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.73,0:10:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Passados eles, responderei adequadamente.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.90,0:10:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Está pronto?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.41,0:10:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Fica para depois, Tohsaka.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.74,0:10:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Quê? Shirou!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.83,0:10:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Quê? Shirou!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.25,0:10:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Saber, as for the plan itself...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.92,0:10:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Tohsaka!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.25,0:10:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ora, que inusitado.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.97,0:11:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Magos ou não, é lamentável.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.64,0:11:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuzuki! Está sendo controlado pela Feiticeira?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.52,0:11:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que não te mato logo?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.12,0:11:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Pode dizer.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.78,0:11:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Você é um ser humano decente, não é?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.08,0:11:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Se for, jamais faria vistas grossas\Npara o que ela vem fazendo.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.71,0:11:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.30,0:11:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela drena a mana das pessoas da cidade.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.81,0:11:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Você acha que eu, Mestre da Feiticeira,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.40,0:11:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,faço vistas grossas para as ações\Ndela por estar sob seu controle?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:53.03,0:11:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso. Se for o caso,\Nsó ela será derrotada.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:58.49,0:12:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso. Se for o caso,\Nsó ela será derrotada.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.87,0:12:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora, se você deu a ela\Nliberdade sabendo o que ela faria,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:02.87,0:12:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora, se você deu a ela\Nliberdade sabendo o que ela faria,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.96,0:12:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,você não passa de outro assassino.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.21,0:12:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Não terá o meu perdão.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:07.67,0:12:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Não terá o meu perdão.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:14.43,0:12:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this is a surprise.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.34,0:12:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Não. Eu não sabia de nada.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.18,0:12:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Só que, Emiya,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.68,0:12:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,serão mesmo as ações dela tão ruins?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.56,0:12:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Como é... que é?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:29.77,0:12:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,A morte de estranhos, sejam\Nquantos forem, não me diz respeito.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.57,0:12:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,A morte de estranhos, sejam\Nquantos forem, não me diz respeito.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:35.53,0:12:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Da mesma maneira como\Na minha não lhes diz respeito.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:37.45,0:12:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Da mesma maneira como\Na minha não lhes diz respeito.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.95,0:12:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuzuki, você é um mago,\Nmas faz uso de terceiros?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:42.54,0:12:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuzuki, você é um mago,\Nmas faz uso de terceiros?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.12,0:12:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Não sou um mago.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.67,0:12:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Não sou um mago.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.71,0:12:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Não participarei da Guerra do Santo Graal.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:54.38,0:12:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Enquanto ela matar e o resto de você\Nmatarem uns aos outros, não tomarei partido.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.22,0:12:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Enquanto ela matar e o resto de você\Nmatarem uns aos outros, não tomarei partido.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:58.51,0:13:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Não assumirei responsabilidade\Nalguma pelas suas lutas
Dialogue: 10,0:13:02.22,0:13:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Não assumirei responsabilidade\Nalguma pelas suas lutas
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.39,0:13:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,e nenhum de vocês precisa se\Nsentir responsável pela minha vida.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.19,0:13:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Prossiga como bem entender, Feiticeira.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.32,0:13:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Matá-los ou deixá-los viver,\Na decisão cabe a você.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.78,0:13:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,É mesmo?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.99,0:13:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Então queres me dizer não\Ntens receio de morrer aqui,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.41,0:13:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Mestre da Feiticeira?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.25,0:13:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Saber!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.96,0:13:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you gave Caster free rein, knowing what she was up to,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.34,0:13:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,that makes you no more than a killer.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.84,0:13:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Alto lá, Saber!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:47.77,0:13:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this is the first I've heard of this.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.61,0:13:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,However, Emiya...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.61,0:13:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Are Caster's actions really so terrible?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:59.32,0:14:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Me subestima, Saber!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:01.87,0:14:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The deaths of strangers, no matter the number, \Nare of no concern to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:06.41,0:14:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as they are not the least bit concerned about {\rDefault-Italic}my{\rDefault} life.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:10.63,0:14:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuzuki...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:12.21,0:14:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a mage, but you'd involve outsiders?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.42,0:14:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I am no mage.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:19.13,0:14:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Os punhos são fortalecidos com magia?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.80,0:14:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Belas evasivas.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:25.85,0:14:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,mas a sua intuição.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:31.19,0:14:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I will bear no responsibility for your fighting,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:35.69,0:14:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,and neither should any of you bear responsibility for my life.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:40.41,0:14:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Do as you wish, Caster.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:43.32,0:14:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether you let them live or kill them is up to you.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:47.62,0:14:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.96,0:14:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you have no qualms about dying here,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.75,0:14:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Master of Caster?{https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=u7ctcdM-n9E}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.71,0:14:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,É aceitável de se pensar que caiba a\Num Mestre prover apoio da retaguarda,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.98,0:15:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast, Saber.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.15,0:15:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Saber fica por minha conta.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.11,0:15:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Saber fica por minha conta.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:30.12,0:15:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You underestimate me, Saber!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:51.14,0:15:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,His fists have been fortified with magic?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:53.77,0:15:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You evade well.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:55.65,0:15:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah. So it is not your eyes that are keen
Dialogue: 10,0:15:58.32,0:16:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,but your intuition.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.72,0:16:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not possible.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:27.18,0:16:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Trace on!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:31.72,0:16:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But there is an exception to every rule.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:34.39,0:16:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There are also Masters, like me, \Nthat can only fight on the front line.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.03,0:16:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Master...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.65,0:16:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Caster?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:45.66,0:16:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall handle Saber.{lol this bitch. I WILL TAKE THE GREAT RESPONSIBILITY OF KILLING A HALF-DEAD WOMAN}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.45,0:16:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You see to the other Masters.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:51.08,0:16:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.75,0:16:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Suits me.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:55.33,0:16:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You caught Saber by surprise,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.71,0:17:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,but we just need to take you out before you get close.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.98,0:17:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Mestre!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:33.66,0:17:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Está bem.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:35.50,0:17:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Tohsaka's dead.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:39.67,0:17:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let that happen.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:42.38,0:17:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Shirou, está ferido?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:43.96,0:17:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Shirou, está ferido?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.72,0:17:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Complicou.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.93,0:17:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora ele não pisa mais\Npara fora do templo Ryuudou.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.06,0:18:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Não podemos deixá-la à solta!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:32.93,0:18:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Você dominou a projeção\Nantes do fortalecimento?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:41.10,0:18:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,O Kiritsugu dizia que essas eram inúteis e que\Nera para eu me focar nas de fortalecimento.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.48,0:18:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Creio que eu te diria o mesmo.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:48.90,0:18:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Tohsaka?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.12,0:18:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Shirou!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:58.12,0:18:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Shirou!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:59.41,0:19:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Estou bem.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:04.00,0:19:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.01,0:19:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ora, ora! Então foi para\Ncá que você veio?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:16.64,0:19:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ora, ora! Então foi para\Ncá que você veio?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:18.27,0:19:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, chega, não vim incomodar.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:20.98,0:19:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Pouco me importa para\Nonde vai ou o que você faz.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.94,0:19:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora, curte só essa!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:28.23,0:19:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,O figura do Kotomine diz que vai se fazer\Nde cego para tudo o que a gente fizer!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.44,0:19:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,O figura do Kotomine diz que vai se fazer\Nde cego para tudo o que a gente fizer!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:31.49,0:19:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,O figura do Kotomine diz que vai se fazer\Nde cego para tudo o que a gente fizer!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.41,0:19:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele parece te levar\Nmuito em consideração.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.66,0:19:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom, o cara é bom em\Nfazer juízo das pessoas!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:41.96,0:19:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,estou a fim de dar alguma\Ncoisa a ele por toda essa gratidão!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:46.13,0:19:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,E aí, vamos causar um massacre!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:49.38,0:19:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Devore umas almas por\Naí para ficar mais forte!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:53.09,0:19:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Aí vai chegar a hora deles!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:55.09,0:19:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Preciso acertar as coisas com o Emiya!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:57.14,0:19:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Preciso acertar as coisas com o Emiya!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:59.43,0:20:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Preciso acertar as coisas com o Emiya!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.19,0:20:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinji, tu não compreendes\Na natureza do Graal.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:06.86,0:20:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinji, tu não compreendes\Na natureza do Graal.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:09.44,0:20:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Se ansiares pelo Graal,\Nignora os outros Mestres.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:13.78,0:20:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Se ansiares pelo Graal,\Nignora os outros Mestres.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.03,0:20:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Se ansiares pelo Graal,\Nignora os outros Mestres.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:17.87,0:20:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Não passam de sacrifícios.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:21.25,0:20:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Antes de tudo, disponho de\Noutros afazeres a tomar conta.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.21,0:20:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Antes de tudo, disponho de\Noutros afazeres a tomar conta.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.59,0:20:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Não é que eu faça pouco caso de ti.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:31.63,0:20:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A vingança é uma sensação esplendorosa.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.90,0:20:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Aliás, nunca cheguei a te\Nperguntar qual era o seu desejo, né?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.11,0:20:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu tolero o extravagante.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:52.86,0:20:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu tolero o extravagante.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:56.61,0:20:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Acima de tudo, uma decoração\Nextravagante há de ser admirada.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.66,0:21:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Só não há sentido em desperdiçar\No extravagante no supérfluo.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:04.29,0:21:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Há muito, designei dez escravos
Dialogue: 10,0:21:08.17,0:21:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,com a objetivo de sacrificar\Naquele que não faria falta.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:11.80,0:21:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,O que acha que se sucedeu, Shinji?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:16.59,0:21:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não matou todos?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:19.64,0:21:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Nenhum sequer pude matar.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:22.68,0:21:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Eram todos simples trabalhadores, mas\Nno velho mundo, todos tinham o seu valor.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:27.02,0:21:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Eram todos simples trabalhadores, mas\Nno velho mundo, todos tinham o seu valor.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:36.15,0:21:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,e eu não acharia um sequer\Nque eu não poderia matar.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:43.58,0:21:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Não consigo te entender.\NO que é que você quer?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:48.54,0:21:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,o muito de qualquer coisa é repugnante.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:52.34,0:21:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,o muito de qualquer coisa é repugnante.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:55.63,0:21:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Attended to?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:58.22,0:22:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not unsympathetic to your feelings, however.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:02.05,0:22:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Revenge feels divine.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:04.64,0:22:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,To seek pleasure is proof of being human.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:08.14,0:22:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I have done what needs to be done,{Once I have done the needful,}
Dialogue: 10,0:22:11.36,0:22:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall join in your games.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:16.19,0:22:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,C-Come to think of it, I never asked what your wish was, did I?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:22.91,0:22:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I approve of luxury.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:26.00,0:22:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Extravagant decoration is to be admired above all.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:29.96,0:22:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But there is no sense in wasting that upon the superfluous.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:33.63,0:22:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The superfluous?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:36.05,0:22:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Long ago, I selected ten slaves,
Dialogue: 10,0:22:39.13,0:22:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,with the intent of slaying one that would not be missed.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:43.97,0:22:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you suppose happened, Shinji?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:47.98,0:22:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You killed them all, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:52.23,0:22:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I found that I could not slay any of them.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:55.23,0:23:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They were simple laborers, \Nbut in the old world, none were without value.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:02.24,0:23:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But this world overflows with the superfluous.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:06.20,0:23:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I could choose not only ten but thousands
Dialogue: 10,0:23:09.41,0:23:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'd not find a single one amongst them that I could not kill.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:13.38,0:23:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get what you're saying. What is it that you want?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:17.55,0:23:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That is simple.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:19.88,0:23:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Too many of anything is sickening.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:56.85,0:24:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I've opened something that was once closed?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:58.73,0:25:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,If you come any closer, I hope you're prepared to face the consequences.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:01.69,0:25:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, I'll make you admit defeat!
Dialogue: 10,0:25:04.07,0:25:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to be a champion of justice, just like Kiritsugu.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:07.20,0:25:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That is why your ideals are meaningless.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:11.25,0:00:13.25,Default-Italic,,0,0,0,,O seu corpo é composto por lâminas.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:14.12,0:00:17.50,Default-Italic,,0,0,0,,De fogo é o seu sangue e\Nde vidro, seu coração.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:17.50,0:00:19.88,Default-Italic,,0,0,0,,Por todas as batalhas sobrevivera.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.67,0:00:23.17,Default-Italic,,0,0,0,,Em nenhuma delas recuara.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.17,0:00:25.26,Default-Italic,,0,0,0,,Em nenhuma delas compreendido fora.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.55,0:00:31.10,Default-Italic,,0,0,0,,Intoxicado pela vitória em\Numa colina de espadas.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:32.77,0:00:34.94,Default-Italic,,0,0,0,,Destarte, sua vida não\Ndispõe de princípio.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.60,0:00:41.40,Default-Italic,,0,0,0,,Aquele seu corpo, por absoluto,\Né composto de espadas.
